": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/"}, {"text": "Lodging Complaint (PINGALA)", "href": "https://pingala.iitk.ac.in/IITK-0/login"}, {"text": "Lost & Found (Narad)", "href": "http://students.iitk.ac.in/lnf/"}, {"text": "Brihaspati3", "href": "http://brihaspati.nmeict.in/brihaspati/servlet/brihaspati"}, {"text": "Office Orders", "href": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/new/office-orders-dosa-office"}, {"text": "OARS", "href": "http://oars1.cc.iitk.ac.in/"}, {"text": "No Dues", "href": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/"}, {"text": "Students Campus Life", "href": "http://iitk.ac.in/new/student-campus-life"}, {"text": "Health Centre", "href": "http://www.iitk.ac.in/hc/"}, {"text": "FAQs", "href": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/faqs"}, {"text": "Apply for No Dues", "href": "http://172.26.142.68/nodues/"}, {"text": "No Dues for Admin", "href": "http://172.26.142.68/nodues/admini/"}, {"text": "Students Medical Insurance FAQ", "href": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/data/Student_Medical_Insurance_FAQ-05-08-24.pdf"}, {"text": "Contact Us", "href": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/contact-us"}, {"text": "", "href": "http://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/"}, {"text": "COSHA", "href": "http://students.iitk.ac.in/ss/home/cosha-2/"}, {"text": "Counsel of Wardens", "href": "http://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/wardens-of-all-halls-of-residences"}, {"text": "Home", "href": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/"}, {"text": "Webmail", "href": "http://webmail.iitk.ac.in/"}, {"text": "Library", "href": "http://library.iitk.ac.in/"}, {"text": "IITK Home", "href": "http://www.iitk.ac.in/"}, {"text": "Old Website", "href": "http://www.iitk.ac.in/dosaold"}, {"text": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/sspc/", "href": "https://www.iitk.ac.in/sspc/"}, {"text": "Office Automation", "href": "https://oa.iitk.ac.in/"}], "title": "scholarships", "text": "scholarships Home Students Counselling Service Hall Management COSHA Hall of Residence Hall of Residence 1 Hall of Residence 2 Hall of Residence 3 Hall of Residence 4 Hall of Residence 5 Girls Hostel 1 Girls Hostel 2 Hall of Residence 7 Hall of Residence 8 Hall of Residence 9 Hall of Residence 10 Hall of Residence 11 Hall of Residence 12 Hall of Residence 13 Hall of Residence 14 SBRA Council of Wardens SSPC FLP SPO Women's Cell Quick Links Students' Gymkhana Lodging Complaint (PINGALA) Lost & Found (Narad) Brihaspati3 Office Orders OARS No Dues Students Campus Life Health Centre FAQs Fee Structures Apply for No Dues No Dues for Admin Students Medical Insurance FAQ Contact Us News & Events Rules & Notices Students' Body Hall Management COSHA Hall of Residence Counsel of Wardens Antiragging Our Team You are here: Home scholarships Webmail | Library | IITK Home | Old Website SCHOLARSHIPS 1. How many scholarships are run by IIT Kanpur? Answer: The following scholarships run by IIT Kanpur: a) Merit-cum-Means b) Free Basic Mess c) INSPIRE scholarships d) Donor scholarships 2. What are the eligibility criteria for applying in above scholarships? Answer: For the eligibility criterion and other details, please refer the following link: https://www.iitk.ac.in/sspc/ 3. How can I apply for the eligible scholarship(s)? Answer: A notification is sent to all students with the scholarship forms and eligibility criterion. The filled forms are to be submitted to the SSPC Office, through e-mails ( This email address is being protected from spambots. You need JavaScript enabled to view it. ) or by hand at FB 272 E, SSPC Office, c/o DoSA Office, IIT Kanpur). 4. What is the process for signature on External Scholarships (KVPY, NTSE, FITJEE, Inspire, Samsung etc.)? Answer: Related forms filled up and duly signed by the applicant & their parents wherever applicable are to be submitted to the SSPC office either in hardcopy or scanned manner ( This email address is being protected from spambots. You need JavaScript enabled to view it. ). Fee receipt of the 1 st semester of the current academic year and grade sheets till the 2 nd semester of pervious academic year are to be attached with the form. 5. I am first year student of an academic year. When should I apply for the scholarships? Answer: First announcement mail is sent in August. Second announcement is sent in January for MCM/FBM/INSPIRE. 6. Are the Scholarships semester- wise? Answer: No, all the scholarships are yearly. 7. If I have availed the scholarship in my first year do I need to apply for every year? Answer: Yes, you have to apply for every academic year, separately. 8. For what kind of scholarships, I can get the Bonafide certificate from SSPC? Answer: Yes, you can get bonafide certificate only related to scholarship from SSPC. 9. I am PG (MTech/MSR/PhD) student, where I can get information for Assistantship/Stipend? Answer: You contact to DOAA Office for the above information. 10. What kind of no objection certificates related to scholarships are issued by the SSPC Office? Answer: Only scholarships related NOC is issued by SSPC. 11. Whom should I contact for query related to scholarships? Answer: Please call us at 0512-259-6187 or mail This email address is being protected from spambots. You need JavaScript enabled to view it.", "kind": "html", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en-gb\" lang=\"en-gb\" dir=\"ltr\" >\n  <head>\n      <base href=\"https://www.iitk.ac.in/dosa/scholarships\" />\n  <meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Govind\" />\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Joomla! - Open Source Content Management\" />\n  <title>scholarships</title>\n  <link href=\"/dosa/templates/iitk/favicon.ico\" rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/dosa/plugins/system/slprettyphoto/slprettyphoto/css/prettyPhoto.css\" type=\"text/css\" />\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/dosa/plugins/system/mediabox_ck/mediabox_ck/media